# Everything in this repository uses LF and UTF-8 without a BOM.
#
# Without this, the line ending of a checked-out file depends on the machine's git configuration:
# a default clone on Windows produces CRLF and one on Linux produces LF, so the same commit
# produces different bytes and a formatting check over the working tree can disagree with itself.
# Pinning it here makes the working tree identical everywhere, which is what makes the format
# check in CI mean anything.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lock files are generated; leave them exactly as written.
packages.lock.json -text

# Binary assets, for the day there are any.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary